From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muthukumar <muthukumardce@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Mar 2026 18:05:29 +0530
Subject: Fix Tier 1-2 fingerprint leaks across Blink renderer
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Closes remaining fingerprint signal gaps identified in the comprehensive
audit. Each fix uses the established ForBinding + SeededNoise pattern for
deterministic, per-session noise that is consistent across page reloads.

Tier 1 (machine-unique) fixes:
- OfflineAudioContext: noise rendered buffer in FireCompletionEvent()
  before resolving the JS promise (audioSeed, ±0.0001 per sample)
- Font allowlist: parse and enforce font allow-list in navigator_ua_data
- Storage usage: override usage_in_bytes in storage_manager.cc alongside
  existing quota override

Tier 2 (hardware-class) fixes:
- WebGL constants: clamp MAX_TEXTURE_SIZE (16384), MAX_VERTEX_ATTRIBS (16),
  MAX_VERTEX/FRAGMENT_UNIFORM_VECTORS, MAX_VARYING_VECTORS,
  MAX_TEXTURE_IMAGE_UNITS, MAX_COMBINED_TEXTURE_IMAGE_UNITS to standard
  Chrome/ANGLE values in getParameterForBinding()
- WebGL extensions: filter getSupportedExtensionsForBinding() against
  allowlist of ~28 common Chrome/ANGLE extensions
- Performance.timeOrigin: add ForBinding with ±50ms deterministic offset
  (performanceSeed, index 4)

DOM rect gap fixes:
- Range.getClientRects(): add ForBinding with per-rect noise (domSeed,
  indices 40+i*4)
- IntersectionObserverEntry.intersectionRect/rootBounds: add ForBinding
  (domSeed, indices 35-42)
- Element.clientTop/clientLeft: add ForBinding (domSeed, indices 16,17)

Other fixes:
- Speech synthesis: filter non-Google system voices via std::remove_if;
  shuffle voice list with Fisher-Yates using speechSeed
- Timezone: replace process.env.TZ hack with ICU TimeZone::adoptDefault()
  + V8 DateTimeConfigurationChangeNotification(kSkip)
- Locale: add ICU SetICUDefaultLocale() + V8 LocaleConfigurationChangeNotification()
  for full Intl.* locale override
- Battery: add ParseDouble support for "inf"/"infinity" strings to handle
  dischargingTime=Infinity serialization

Files modified (20):
- v8_builtin_overrides.cc (timezone/locale ICU overrides)
- element.cc/h/idl (clientTop/clientLeft ForBinding)
- range.cc/h/idl (getClientRects ForBinding)
- navigator_ua_data.cc/h (storageUsage + infinity parsing)
- intersection_observer_entry.cc/h/idl (intersectionRect/rootBounds)
- performance.cc/h/idl (timeOrigin ForBinding)
- storage_manager.cc (usage override)
- speech_synthesis.cc (voice filtering + shuffle)
- offline_audio_context.cc/h (rendered buffer noise)
- webgl_rendering_context_base.cc (GL constant clamping + extension filter)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

